([P1] The health ministry has launched a campaign reminding residents to drink) Tj
T*
(water regularly during the current heatwave. The campaign will run on radio, in) Tj
T*
(clinics and on noticeboards in public buildings.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P2] Officials advised people to avoid strenuous outdoor work during the hottest) Tj
T*
(hours and to check on older neighbours. Swimming in rivers and lakes is) Tj
T*
(discouraged where there is no lifeguard, and several sites have been marked with) Tj
T*
(warning signs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
([P3] The ministry said hospitals have seen an increase in cases of heat) Tj
T*
(exhaustion but that services remain open. A free advice line will operate during) Tj
T*
(daylight hours for the rest of the week.) Tj
